  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq Foundation - Technological Advance to BolsterFreedom of Expression in Iraq - TABEIR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Iraq Foundation - Teknikutveckling f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka yttrandefriheten i Irak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka demokrati och yttrandefrihet I Irak  genom att uppmuntra civila akt&#xf6;rer att bli f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsakt&#xf6;rer.        M&#xe5;lgruper &#xe4;r journalister, medborgare journalister, aktivister och    NGOs i Irak.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote democracy and protect freedom of          expression by empowering civic actors to become agents for change.    Target groups are journalists, citizen journalist, activists and NGOs in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
